      <rules>
        <rule name="Violent Fury" id="fd05-fa89-4f79-c9ac" hidden="false">
          <description>Any Orc unit joined by a Warchanter may re-roll 1&apos;s To Hit and To Wound in close combat.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Warbeats" id="9999-46bc-bdf4-3271" hidden="false">
          <description>A Warchanter knows three Warbeats. They may attempt to use one at the start of each of your turns by taking a Leadership test on their own unmodified Leadership. If passed, the Warbeat is answered and take immediate effect. Each Warbeat lasts until the start of your next turn. A friendly unit can only be under the effect of one Warbeat at a time.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
