                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Big Stabba" id="f44c-19e9-1d24-b925" hidden="false">
                  <description>A unit of Savage Orc Boyz may be upgraded to include Big Stabbas. This is represented by including one or more Big Stabba models in the unit. A Big Stabba is mounted on two Infantry bases and must be placed to cover both the first and second rank of the unit, but is otherwise equipped like the rest of the unit. Each Big Stabba model causes D3 Impact Hits with the Multiple Wounds (D3) special rule. Big Stabbas are always the last models to be removed as casualties (excluding any Command Group models); the weapons are picked up by other Savage Orcs in the unit should they be slain.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
