              <rules>
                <rule name="Nasty Skulkers" id="02ec-9247-ca83-5f80" hidden="false">
                  <description>Nasty Skulkers are equipped with two hand weapons and have the Hidden special rule. They may be targeted separately from the rest of the unit, just like characters. In addition, they have the Always Strikes First and Armour Piercing (1) special rules in any turn they are revealed or the unit they are with successfully charges an enemy in the flank or rear.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
