                <rule name="Twackwheezer Puffshrooms" id="abb8-0020-b7a6-82e3" hidden="false">
                  <description>Twackwheezer Puffshrooms replace the Fanatic&apos;s normal Strength 5 Hits. All models Hit must pass a Toughness test or suffer a Wound which Ignores Armour Saves. In addition, all units where the majority of the models are within 6&quot; of a Fanatic with this upgrade count as being in soft cover.</description>
