          <rules>
            <rule name="Squigs Go Wild" id="5316-88ec-44a8-c5eb" hidden="false">
              <description>If the unit would flee, or if at any time there are only Squigs left alive in the unit with no Herders, all units within 2D6&quot; (friend and foe) immediately take D6 Strength 5 hits. For every 5 Cave Squigs remaining when the Squigs Go Wild, add +1 to the number of hits caused. After damage is resolved, the Squig Herd is removed in its entirety.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
