              <rules>
                <rule name="Deff Creepers" id="650a-2604-f87b-cb4e" hidden="false">
                  <description>Snagla Grobspit must be accompanied by a unit of Forest Goblin Spider Riders chosen from the army list at a cost of +2 points per model. This unit has the Ambushers, Devastating Charge and Hatred (Empire) special rules. In addition, they cause Fear on any turn that they charge. Snagla Grobspit may never choose to leave this unit.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
