              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Mimic" id="399b-1ed7-50dd-ba3f" hidden="false">
              <description>A Snotling unit must deploy within 6&quot; of friendly Orc or Goblin unit, and must attempt to move to within 6&quot; of one if further away. If a Snotling unit is within 6&quot; of a friendly Orc or Goblin unit, they will mimic the nearest of these. If the Orc or Goblin unit declares a charge, the Snotling unit must also declare a charge against the same target. If the Orc or Goblin unit flees, the Snotling unit will move in the same direction.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
    </selectionEntry>
