                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="de63-d6da-efa8-00ac">One use only. Wollopa&apos;s One Hit Wunda may be used at the start of any close combat phase when it is the wielder&apos;s turn to attack. The wielder may replace all its normal Attacks with a special attack that is resolved at +3 S with Heroic Killing Blow.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
