" type="append" value="Whenever the wielder&apos;s To Hit roll on a D6 is higher than his target&apos;s Weapon Skill, the attack will not only hit regardless of the score normally needed to hit, but will also be multiplied into 2 Hits."/>
                  </modifiers>
