" type="append" value="When targeting a Wizard in close combat, the wielder may re-roll failed rolls To Hit and gains the Multiple Wounds (D3)
special rule. When targeting a Character that is not a Wizard in close combat, the wielder may re-roll failed rolls To Wound and gains the Killing Blow special rule. "/>
