                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">One use only. This item can be used at the start of any close combat phase. One enemy monster in base contact with the bearer of this item must take a number of Toughness tests equal to their starting number of Wounds. Each failed Toughness test causes D3 Wounds with no saves allowed. This has no effect against Daemons or Animated Constructs.</characteristic>
