                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="3df8-4ab0-c4bd-e2ad">At the start of each of your Magic phases, the Staff of Sneaky Stealin&apos; allows you to remove one dice from the opponent&apos;s Dispel dice pool and add it to your own Power dice pool.</characteristic>
