              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="97aa-092b-c6fe-4f5a">The unit carrying this standard gains D6&quot; to its charge distance. This does not affect the unit&apos;s maximum charge range for the purpose of determining mandatory charge declarations. If the charge is failed, the unit will move forward its normal failed charge distance.</characteristic>
